  ⧗:C̵,ef,S,op ⧗:gk ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:C,ff,SS,oo ⧗:C̵,ff ⦄ ⦃ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹einstS› ⦄ ⦃ ‹einstrec› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
