⍝ ---- reversible functions (§10): the inverse is generated at compile time, as new tree nodes
⍝ at the end of the heap: the units of the body reversed, each one inverted. Kind 18 is an op
⍝ whose ⊞ and ⊟ swap places.

⍝ ‹einverse› C r: emit ⇜name for the emit record r (its node is the original function)
⦃
  ⧖:C,r
  ⧗:C̵,r ‹rd› ⧖:C,name ⧗:C̵,r △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,sym ⧗:C̵,r #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,f
